{"id":1340,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/present-simple-forms-of-to-be/","parentId":540,"order":1,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"Present simple forms of ‘to be’: am/is/are","seo":{"title":"Present simple forms of 'to be': am/is/are - Test-English","description":"Learn the present simple of 'to be' (am, is, are) in this A1 Elementary grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A1-Grammar_Be-forms.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T08:50:17","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct present simple forms of ‘to be’ for the gaps below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"258\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Rewrite the sentences using the short forms of <em>be</em>.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: They are good friends ⇒ <span class=\"textGap\">They’re</span> good friends.</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"259\"></div> <p></p>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Rewrite these sentences using the negative and interrogative forms of ‘to be’. <span class=\"highlighter\">Use contractions</span> when possible.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: They are friends ⇒ <span class=\"textGap\">They aren’t</span> friends. ⇒ <span class=\"textGap\">Are they</span> friends?</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"417\"></div> <p></p>","<h3>Exercise 4</h3> <h5>Fill in the gaps with&nbsp;the correct&nbsp;present simple forms of ‘to be’.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"260\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h2>The present simple of <strong>be</strong>: Form</h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/present_simple_be-form.png\" alt=\"Educational chart illustrating the present simple forms of the verb 'to be' with examples in positive, negative, and question forms, alongside short answers for an elementary-level English grammar lesson.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10789\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <p>The present simple of the verb<strong>&nbsp;be</strong>&nbsp;has three forms:</p> <div class=\"infoblock\"> ‣ I&nbsp;<strong>am</strong>.<br> ‣ He/She/It<strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>is</strong>.<br> ‣ We/You/They<strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>are</strong>. </div> <h4><strong>They</strong>= people and things</h4> <p>We use <strong>he</strong> for a man, <strong>she</strong> for a woman, and <strong>it</strong> for a thing.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><strong><span>He</span></strong>‘s&nbsp;a little boy.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em><strong><span>She</span></strong>‘s beautiful.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I like this TV.<span><strong> It</strong></span>‘s very big.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>they</strong> for people and for things.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I love Sara and Jonas. <span><strong>They</strong></span> are my friends.</em></li> <li><em>I love these chairs. <span><strong>They</strong></span> are very beautiful.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Don’t forget the subject</h4> <p>We always need a <a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/object-pronouns/\">subject</a> before the verb.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>It is</strong></span> cold. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Is</strong></span> cold. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Sally is</strong></span> a wonderful woman. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Is</strong></span> a wonderful woman. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> </ul> <h4>Contractions or short forms</h4> <p>We use <strong>‘m,&nbsp;</strong><strong>‘s&nbsp;</strong>and ‘<strong>re&nbsp;</strong>with personal pronouns (<strong>I, you, he, etc.</strong>)</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><strong><span>I’m</span> </strong>sad.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>You’re</strong></span> tired.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>She’s</strong></span> from Scotland.</em></li> </ul> <p>But we can also use&nbsp;<strong>‘s</strong> with names.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><strong><span>Laura’s</span></strong> beautiful.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>London’s</strong></span> an expensive city.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h4>Contractions in short answers</h4> <p>We can only use <strong>contractions</strong> in <strong>negative short answers</strong>. Not in positive short answers.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Yes, <span><span><strong>I am</strong></span><span>. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></em></li> <li><em>Yes, <strong><span>I’m</span></strong>. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em>Yes, <span><strong>she&nbsp;is</strong></span><span><span>. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></em></li> <li><em>Yes, <span><strong>she’s</strong></span>. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em>Yes, <span><strong>they&nbsp;are</strong></span>. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em>Yes, <span><strong>they’re</strong></span>. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> </ul> <h2>The present simple of <strong>be</strong> – USE</h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/be-different-uses.png\" alt=\"Infographic displaying various uses of the verb 'to be', including introducing people, age, job, nationality, feelings, color, prices, weather, time, and descriptions, with example sentences.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10801\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <p>We use the verb&nbsp;<strong>be</strong> to talk about:</p> <div class=\"textBox\"> <p><strong>Who we are</strong>:<em> I<span><strong>‘m</strong></span> Steven, and this <span><strong>is</strong></span> Isabella. And this <span><strong>is</strong></span> my daughter, Alicia.</em></p> <p><strong>Age</strong>: <em>I<span><strong>‘m</strong></span> 24 years old, and my father <span><strong>is</strong></span> 50.&nbsp;</em></p> <p><strong>Job:<em>&nbsp;</em></strong><em>I<span><strong>‘m</strong></span> a teacher, and my wife <span><strong>is</strong></span> a doctor.&nbsp;</em></p> <p><strong>Nationality:&nbsp;</strong><em>Alex <span><strong>is</strong></span> from Ireland, and Sonia <span><strong>is</strong></span> from Spain.</em></p> <p><strong>Feelings</strong>: <em>I<span><strong>‘m</strong> </span>scared. She <span><strong>is</strong></span> very tired.&nbsp;</em></p> <p><strong>Colour</strong>:&nbsp;<em>Our dog <span><strong>is</strong></span> black. His eyes <span><strong>are</strong></span> blue.</em></p> <p><strong>Prices</strong>:<em>&nbsp;It<span><strong>‘s</strong></span> seven pounds. This T-shirt <span><strong>is</strong></span> twenty dollars. &nbsp;</em></p> <p><strong>The weather</strong>: <em>It<span><strong>‘s</strong></span> sunny today. It <span><strong>is</strong></span> very cold this morning.&nbsp;</em></p> <p><strong>The time</strong>: <em>What time <span><strong>is</strong></span> it? It<span><strong>‘s</strong></span> ten past four.&nbsp;</em></p> <p><strong>Descriptions in general</strong>: <em>He <span><strong>is</strong></span> very short and thin. The cars <span><strong>are</strong></span> old and cheap.&nbsp;</em></p> </div>","quizzes":[{"id":258,"questions":[{"id":2242,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> you a teacher? B: Yes, I <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["is","Are"]},{"kind":"select","options":["am","are"]}]},{"id":2243,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your name Marcus? B: Yes, it <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Are","Is"]},{"kind":"select","options":["are","is"]}]},{"id":2244,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your children here? B: No, they <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Are","am"]},{"kind":"select","options":["aren't","isn't"]}]},{"id":2245,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> this your suitcase? B: No, it <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Is","Are"]},{"kind":"select","options":["isn't","aren't"]}]},{"id":2246,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: Where <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> we? B: I think this <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> Oxford street.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["am","is","are"]},{"kind":"select","options":["is","are"]}]},{"id":2247,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> it Saturday today? B: No, It <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> Sunday.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Is","Are"]},{"kind":"select","options":["'re","'s"]}]},{"id":2248,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your friends from the UK? B: No, <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> from the US.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Are","Is"]},{"kind":"select","options":["they are","he is"]}]},{"id":2249,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: Hello, Maria. How <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> you? B: <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> fine, thanks.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["am","are"]},{"kind":"select","options":["I'm","I are"]}]},{"id":2250,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: How old <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> Peter? B: I think <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> 30 years old.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["are","is"]},{"kind":"select","options":["it is","he is"]}]},{"id":2251,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> David and Molly here? B: Yes, <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> next to the door.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Are","Is"]},{"kind":"select","options":["we're","they're"]}]}]},{"id":259,"questions":[{"id":3584,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She is fantastic ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> fantastic. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3585,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We are in Spain ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> in Spain.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3586,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>You are not my friend ⇒ You <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> my friend.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3587,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Sheila is from Brighton. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> from Brighton.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3588,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The chairs are not expensive. ⇒ The chairs <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> expensive. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3589,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I am not British ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> British. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3590,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Clara is a good student. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a good student.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3591,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>You are great. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> great. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3592,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>They are my friends. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> my friends.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3593,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He is not angry. ⇒ He <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> angry.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]},{"id":417,"questions":[{"id":3595,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She is a teacher. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a teacher. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> a teacher?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3596,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>They're in Berlin. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> in Berlin. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> in Berlin?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3597,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>It's a nice day. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a nice day. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> a nice day?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3598,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I am very excited. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> very excited. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> very excited?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3599,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We are students. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> students. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> students?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3600,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>You are right. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> right. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> right?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3601,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>It's 6 o'clock. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> 6 o'clock. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> 6 o'clock?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3602,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The table is blue. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> blue. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> blue? </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3603,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He is the new manager. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the new manager. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> the new manager?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3604,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>They are sorry. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> sorry. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> sorry?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]}]},{"id":260,"questions":[{"id":2252,"num":"","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>SOFIE: Hello. <span class=\"numBox\">1</span> <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> you from here?<br> <br> DINO: No, we <span class=\"numBox\">2</span> <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>. And you? <span class=\"numBox\">3</span> <span data-gap=\"2\"></span> you from here?<br> <br> SOFIE: No, I <span class=\"numBox\">4</span> <span data-gap=\"3\"></span> from France. My name <span class=\"numBox\">5</span> <span data-gap=\"4\"></span> SOFIE.<br> <br> DINO: Nice to meet you. I <span class=\"numBox\">6</span> <span data-gap=\"5\"></span>&nbsp;DINO. And this <span class=\"numBox\">7</span> <span data-gap=\"6\"></span> Francesca.<br> <br> SOFIE: Where <span class=\"numBox\">8</span> <span data-gap=\"7\"></span> you from?<br> <br> DINO: We <span class=\"numBox\">9</span> <span data-gap=\"8\"></span> from Italy.<br> <br> SOFIE: <span class=\"numBox\">10</span> <span data-gap=\"9\"></span> you from Rome?<br> <br> DINO: No, we <span class=\"numBox\">11</span> <span data-gap=\"10\"></span>. We <span class=\"numBox\">12</span> <span data-gap=\"11\"></span> from the north of Italy. I <span class=\"numBox\">13</span> <span data-gap=\"12\"></span> from Torino, and Francesca <span class=\"numBox\">14</span> <span data-gap=\"13\"></span> from Milano.<br> <br> SOFIE: <span class=\"numBox\">15</span> <span data-gap=\"14\"></span> you here on holiday?<br> <br> DINO: No, we <span class=\"numBox\">16</span> <span data-gap=\"15\"></span>. It <span class=\"numBox\">17</span> <span data-gap=\"16\"></span> a study trip. This <span class=\"numBox\">18</span> <span data-gap=\"17\"></span> a beautiful place.<br> <br> SOFIE: Yes, it <span class=\"numBox\">19</span> <span data-gap=\"18\"></span>. <span class=\"numBox\">20</span> <span data-gap=\"19\"></span> the trip nice?<br> <br> DINO:&nbsp;Very nice</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}